%% Flow Chart A — Payroll Direct Deposit → Yield Token Mint
%% Reference: Capstone §11, Flow Chart A

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant EMP as Employer ACH
  participant GAL as Galileo Core
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant ORC as RWA Orchestration
  participant ORACLE as Chainlink Oracle (mock)
  participant KYT as Chainalysis KYT (mock)
  participant DRT as DepositReceiptToken.sol (Besu)
  participant APP as Chime App

  EMP->>GAL: ACH credit $1,250
  GAL->>GW: POST /webhooks/galileo<br/>event=directDeposit.credited<br/>HMAC-SHA256
  GW->>GW: Verify HMAC + nonce + 5-min window
  GW->>ORC: Validated event
  ORC->>ORACLE: GET current 4-week T-bill yield
  ORACLE-->>ORC: 4.82% APY
  ORC->>KYT: Screen source address
  KYT-->>ORC: cleared
  ORC->>DRT: mintFor(account, 1250e18, 0.0482)
  DRT-->>ORC: TokenMinted(event_id, token_id)
  ORC->>APP: WebSocket push<br/>"$1,250.00 earning 4.82% APY"
  Note over ORC,APP: Consumer never sees<br/>token_id, gas, or wallet addr
